CONTENT-TYPE RULES (Pixel art cleanup / upscale): Pixel art. The result must stay true pixel art: the same pixel grid, every original pixel becomes a crisp block, the same palette with no new colours, no gradients, no anti-aliasing, no blurring and no smoothing. Remove only clear artifacts such as stray noisy pixels. For this content type, hard pixel edges and flat colour areas are correct (they override the smooth-gradient wish in section 4). Keep the pixel size identical in every tile.

